 321:../src/miv_rv32_hal/miv_rv32_hal.c ****          1 Instruction access fault       (mtval/mtval is the address)
 322:../src/miv_rv32_hal/miv_rv32_hal.c ****          2 Illegal instruction            (mtval/mtval contains the
 323:../src/miv_rv32_hal/miv_rv32_hal.c ****                                            offending instruction opcode)
 324:../src/miv_rv32_hal/miv_rv32_hal.c ****          3 Breakpoint
